  "body": "Found during the theme audit for #2039 (`upstream/main` `31f8d03d7`). Companion to #2025 (open PR #2038).\n\nWhat is fixed today:\n- `crates/ui/src/egui_app/panes.rs:928`: `pub(super) const DROP_W: f32 = 200.0;` (used for ribbon dropdown panels across `panes.rs:925,1028,1262,1562`, `fixture_menu.rs:87,100`, `theme_drop.rs:56,61,81`, and `tree_menu.rs:188,207`).\n- `crates/ui/src/egui_app/panes.rs:929`: `pub(super) const DROP_GAP: f32 = 2.0;` (gap between trigger button and popup panel + hover zone across `panes.rs`, `fixture_menu.rs:86`, `recent_drop.rs:115,201`, `theme_drop.rs:60,141`, and `tree_menu.rs:184`).\n- `crates/ui/src/egui_app/recent_drop.rs:22`: `pub(super) const RECENT_W: f32 = 300.0;` (used at `:111,116,150`).\n- Dropdown item horizontal padding / icon placement is repeated as literals: `8.0` left text inset across `panes.rs:927,1444`, `fixture_menu.rs:107`, `recent_drop.rs:171`, `theme_drop.rs:113`, `tree_menu.rs:233`; `4.0` clip inset in `recent_drop.rs:170`; `16.0` item icon size in `panes.rs:1307`; and `14.0` / `10.0` checkbox geometry + `28.0` label inset in `crates/ui/src/egui_app/layout/mod.rs:255-256,269`.\n\nDone means:\n- Shared dropdown menu widths (`DROP_W` / `RECENT_W`), trigger gap (`DROP_GAP`), and menu item horizontal padding come from theme tokens (clamped cleanly so narrow windows stay usable, preserving `machine_menu_width` expansion).\n- All five dropdown drawers (`panes.rs`, `recent_drop.rs`, `theme_drop.rs`, `tree_menu.rs`, `fixture_menu.rs`, plus `layout/mod.rs` View rows) read the shared values.\n- Once #2038 merges, `assets/themes/theme.json.example` includes any new keys and its key-set test passes.\n",
